en declined by the auctioneer. You can contact the auctioneer on 612-564-3726 for more information.\r\n        </span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"leadingMessage\" class=\"ui positive message hide bidMessage\">\r\n        <i class=\"green icon attention\"></i>\r\n        <span class=\"content\">\r\n            <span class=\"header\"><strong>\r\nYou are the current highest bidder!                </strong></span>\r\n                <span>\r\n                    To be sure to win, come back on\r\n                    <span>\r\n                        <time datetime=\" 2026-01-28T04-11-00Z\">\r\n                            Jan 28, 2026 10:11am CT\r\n\r\n                            <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"a11y\">Date Format</span>\r\n                        </time>\r\n                    </span>\r\n                    as the lot closes or increase your max bid.\r\n                </span>\r\n        </span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"registeredMessage\" class=\"ui info message hide\">\r\n        <i class=\"blue icon attention\"></i>\r\n        <span class=\"content\">\r\n            <strong>Leave a bid now!</strong>  Your registration has been successful.\r\n        </span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"lotEndedMessage\" class=\"ui warning message hide\">\r\n        <span class=\"content\">\r\n            <strong>Sorry, bidding has ended on this item.</Strong> We have thousands of new lots everyday, start a new search.\r\n        </span>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"lotNotStartedMessage\" class=\"ui warning message hide\">\r\n        <i class=\"yellow icon attention\"></i>\r\n        <span class=\"content\">\r\n            Bidding on this auction has not started. Please register now so you are approved to bid when auction starts.\r\n        </span>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n    <div class=\"ui horizontal divider\"></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <!-- Lot details container-->\r\n    <div class=\"ui container\">\r\n        <div class=\"ui stackabl