        </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <!-- Shipping content -->\r\n                <div class=\"ui bottom attached tab segment\" data-tab=\"shipping\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                    <div id=\"delivery-information\" class=\"delivery-information tinyMCEContent\">\r\n                        <p>Shipping will be available for all smaller items under 75 lbs via FedEx, UPS, or USPS</p>\n<p>Larger orders can be combined and banded to a pallet or crated for a fee.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Fram Fram, LLC is NOT responsible for setting up the freight or trucking logistics.&nbsp;</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <!-- T&C content -->\r\n                <div class=\"ui bottom attached tab segment\" data-tab=\"terms\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                    <h3 id=\"important-info\" class=\"ui header\">Important Information</h3>\r\n\r\n                    <div id=\"importantSaleInfoText\" class=\"tinyMCEContent\">\r\n                        <p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>=====================================================</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\">BidSpotter Customer Service Support Department</span>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Have a question pertaining to the bidding process?&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Visit our<strong>&nbsp;</strong><a title=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb\" href=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></a><strong>!&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>You can also start a live chat with a Bidspotter Support Representative by selecting&nbsp;Live Chat&nbsp;at the top of Bidspotter.com. More information on our chat system can be found by&nbsp;<a title=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb/articles/115000035693-how-do-i-contact-bidspotter-com-\" href=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb/articles/115000035693-How-do-I-contact-BidSpotter-com-\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>clicking here</strong></a><strong>.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Customer Support Hours:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Monday – Friday</strong>, 8:00 AM ET – 8:00 PM ET</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Email:&nbsp;</strong><a title=\"mailto:support@bidspotter.com\" href=\"mailto:support@bidspotter.com\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>support@bidspotter.com</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Office:</strong> 253-858-6777 <strong>Toll Free:</strong> 866-597-2437</p>\n<p><a title=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb\" href=\"https://support.bidspotter.com/hc/en-gb\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Frequently Asked Questions</strong></a></p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <h3 id=\"terms\" class=\"ui header\">Terms and Conditions</h3>\r\n                    <div id=\"salesTermsText\" class=\"terms tinyMCEContent\">\r\n                        \r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                    <a href=\"/en-us/auction-catalogues/bscfra/catalogue-id-bscfra10019/terms-and-conditions\">\r\n                        See Full Terms And Conditions\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n<!-- Catalogue items slick carousel -->\r\n    <!-- Slick Carousel -->\r\n    <div class=\"twelve wide tablet three wide computer column\">\r\n        <div class=\"ui grid catalogue\">\r\n\r\n            <!-- Breadcrumbs - mobile -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"twelve wide mobile only column breadcrumbs-mobile\">\r\n    <div class=\"ui menu sub-menu mob\">\r\n        \r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ui breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\r\n\r\n            <a class=\"section\" href=\"/en-us\"><span>Home</span> <i class=\"angle right icon\"></i></a>\r\n            <div class=\"active section\">\r\n   